<title>USA: US Senate votes against ending ethanol subsidy.</title>
<headline>US Senate votes against ending ethanol subsidy.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Senate on Friday defeated a proposal to eliminate ethanol subsidies after 2000.</p>
<p>The amendment to the tax bill would have eliminated ethanol subsidies after they expire at the end of 2000.</p>
<p>The tax bill, which is under consideration on the Senate floor, would gradually reduce the ethanol subsidy starting in 2001.</p>
<p>The House tax legislation, passed Thursday, would eliminate the ethanol subsidy after 2000.</p>
<p>((--Washington Newsroom 202 898-8300))</p>
</text>
